# Cleffo credentials are stored encrypted in Supabase Vault.
# Configure CLEFFO_API_KEY, CLEFFO_SIGNATURE_KEY, CLEFFO_CLIENT_KEY,
# and CLEFFO_BASE_URL through server-side configuration only.
# TideCo credentials remain in Supabase Edge Function secrets.
# Never place private keys in browser JavaScript or commit a local .env.
